          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "జీవించు (jīviñcu) is built on Sanskrit jīvati, \"is alive\" (CDIAL 5241), with the Telugu verb ending -iñcu."
            }
