          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "తలదాచుకో — taladācukō — \"to take shelter\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వర్షం వచ్చి మేము ఒక గుడిలో తలదాచుకున్నాము. varṣaṁ vacci mēmu oka guḍilō taladācukunnāmu. It rained, and we took shelter in a temple."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): తలదాచుకున్నాను, taladācukunnānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally to hide one's head: తల, head, and దాచుకో, to hide for oneself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "తలదాచుకో (taladācukō) is a native compound: tala, \"the head\" (DEDR 3103), and dācu, \"to hide\" (DEDR 63), with the self-ending -kō."
            }
          ]
        },
